OmniGPO core

The portable API and packaging accompany the experiment-matched graph and neural
credit implementation. Source provenance is recorded in SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json.

Portions of gigpo/ppo.py and gigpo/tensor_ops.py are extracted/adapted from the
verl/TRL-derived PPO implementation and retain the original notices:
