Changes in those files are extraction and portable import adaptation, not a claim
of inventing PPO, GAE, or the underlying tensor operations. Existing baseline
Gated-BEPO graph credit and its outcome/support gates are preserved, not presented
as new graph-to-critic contributions. No third-party model or dataset is bundled.
